            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Alvin Roussel"
          },
          "reviewBody": "I had a very enjoyable day with Alan and 2 other students in his Woodland Masterclass. He taught us a lot about how to look for and take good images in woodlands. The three of us ranged from beginners to more experienced and he took care to ensure that the post-processing demonstration was helpful to all three of us.",
