            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Amanda Hillary"
          },
          "reviewBody": "Great day on the Peaks photography workshop. Alan was brilliant, took time to work with us all individually and so pleased with the skills and shots I came away with. The smaller group size was a huge bonus too. Highly recommend!",
