        {
          "@type": "Review",
          "author": {
            "@type": "Person",
            "name": "Harsha Patel"
          },
          "reviewBody": "I very much enjoyed Alan Ranger’s residential photography weekend in North Wales, having picked up my camera again after a gap of around 20 years! Alan adapts his teaching style to suit my level of knowledge, making the experience both enjoyable and incredibly informative. I learnt a great deal and came away with a new appreciation of photography as a creative art form, rather than simply taking pictures.  The weekend was engaging, inspiring and full of learning opportunities, with Alan’s great sense of humour an added bonus. I would highly recommend Alan to everyone, from complete beginners to experienced photographers. A fantastic experience!",
